'''Silver Icebreaker''' is a [[Unique Weapons|unique]] knife that was awarded to the player that finished '''2nd''' on the [[Christmas Event 2020|2020 Christmas Event]] '''Coin-Collecting''' Leaderboard.

== Appearance ==
Silver Icebreaker takes a similar shape to the [[BattleAxe]], but larger. It has a thin, long Gray handle with a sharp silver knob at the bottom. The axe appears to be a labrys with two blades encased in silver ice. It has a dark demon-like face in the middle with silver horns, silver eyes, a thin, black nose, and sharp silver teeth.

==Trivia ==
*During the [[Christmas Event 2020|2020 Christmas Event]], there were 2 different leaderboards; '''Gift-Giving''' and '''Coin-Collecting'''.
*In order to obtain this item, participants would collect as many '''[[Snow Tokens|Winter Tokens]]''' (acts exactly like [[coins]]) in order to score points which will determine their rank in the leaderboard.
*Other variants of this include [[Bronze Icebreaker]], [[Red Icebreaker]], and [[Gold Icebreaker]].
* This item is a silver reskin of the [[Ancient Weapons|ancient]] knife [[Icebreaker]].
*Like all other [[Unique Weapons|unique weapons]] (excluding [[Corrupt]]), this item is [[Trading|untradable]].
*The sole owner of this item is '''[https://www.roblox.com/users/119946744/profile ironjenjin]'''.

